# Copy to `.env` for local runs. The file is gitignored.
#
# Keelson reads the process environment first, then `.env`. A profile may name
# its key variable with `api_key_env`; the Anthropic provider also falls back
# to ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
